{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 13 från V, MP.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 13 by V, MP.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Climate Change and Climate Adaptation in Emergency Preparedness", "dok_titel": "Society's Emergency Preparedness", "forslag_text": "Parliament rejects the motions\n\n2025/26:3405 by Emma Berginger et al. (MP) motion 8,\n\n2025/26:3421 by Katarina Luhr et al. (MP) motions 3, 7, 16, 18, 27 and 48,\n\n2025/26:3422 by Katarina Luhr et al. (MP) motion 12 and\n\n2025/26:3556 by Peter Hultqvist et al. (S) motion 87.", "notis": "Parliament rejected 73 proposals in motions from the general motion period of 2025.\nThe proposals dealt among other things with emergency preparedness, fire and rescue services, water supply, climate adaptation and information and cyber security.\nParliament refers among other things to measures already taken and ongoing work.", "alternatives": ["Parliament rejects the motions\n\n2025/26:3405 by Emma Berginger et al. (MP) motion 8,\n\n2025/26:3421 by Katarina Luhr et al. (MP) motions 3, 7, 16, 18, 27 and 48,\n\n2025/26:3422 by Katarina Luhr et al. (MP) motion 12 and\n\n2025/26:3556 by Peter Hultqvist et al. (S) motion 87.", "Reservation 13"]}, "votering_id": "F0F60D6A-EC70-4217-A1E3-A29E48D4CD09", "rm": "2025/26", "beteckning": "FöU9", "punkt": 9, "dok_id": "HD01FöU9", "datum": "2026-03-11", "utskott": "FöU", "rubrik": "Klimatförändringar och klimatanpassning för krisberedskapen", "dok_titel": "Samhällets krisberedskap", "sammanfattning": "Försvarsutskottet föreslår att riksdagen säger nej till 73 förslag i motioner 